# Orbly needs no environment variables for import, parsing, or any data browsing —
# those run entirely client-side against IndexedDB. Only the AI chat's /api/chat
# route needs one, and only for local development.

# Deployed on Vercel: leave this unset. The AI Gateway authenticates automatically
# via Vercel's OIDC token (requires a payment method on file for your Vercel
# account, even to use free-tier credits).
#
# Local development: run `npx vercel env pull .env.local` to pull a working OIDC
# token, or set this yourself with a Vercel AI Gateway API key. Without one, every
# other page still works — only the chat's model responses will fail.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
